# oracle: pair_style eam/cd on FeCr.cdeam (Stukowski et al. 2009, one-site file, Fe and Cr), bcc 3x3x3 cells (54 atoms) at a = 2.87 A, half the sites Cr (set type/fraction), 0.05 A random displacements, velocities create 800 K, fix nve, 100 steps; thermo every 20 steps
# oracle-potentials: FeCr.cdeam
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 7.3e-13, atoms 2.8e-13.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
lattice         bcc 2.87
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             group all type/fraction 2 0.5 2468
mass            1 55.845
mass            2 51.9961
displace_atoms  all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 4711 units box
pair_style      eam/cd
pair_coeff      * * FeCr.cdeam Fe Cr
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step pe ke press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
velocity        all create 800 4928459 rot yes dist gaussian loop geom
run             100
